HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_5ae73529, " or newer is required, and this machine's clang is `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_3bae1570, "` \342\200\224 the flags this compiler passes and the way it reads a header's parameter types were measured on clang 18, 21 and 22; an older clang answers differently, and a guess would be silent. `heroes doctor` says what this machine has");
